==Spanish==

===Etymology===
{{root|es|ine-pro|*peh₂w-}}
{{inh+|es|la|paucus}}, from {{inh|es|itc-pro|*paukos}}, ultimately from the {{der|es|ine-pro|*peh₂w-|t=few, little}}. Compare {{cog|fr|peu}}, {{cog|it|poco}}, {{cog|pt|pouco}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{es-pr|+<audio:Es-poco.wav>}}

===Determiner===
{{head|es|determiner|plural|pocos|feminine|poca|feminine plural|pocas|superlative|poquísimo|g=m}}

# [[little]], not much
#: {{ux|es|Bebí '''poca''' agua.|I drank '''little''' water.}}
#: {{ux|es|Nos casamos hace '''poco''' tiempo.|We got married recently.|lit=We got married '''a little''' time ago.}}
# [[few]], not many
#: {{ux|es|Muy '''pocas''' personas hacen eso.|Very '''few''' people do that.}}
# [[un-]], not
#: {{uxi|es|'''poco''' saludable|'''un'''healthy}}

===Adverb===
{{es-adv}}

# [[little]] {{gloss|not much}}
#: {{ux|es|Comí '''poco'''.|I ate '''little''' / I did'''n’t''' eat '''much'''.}}

===Noun===
{{es-noun|m}}

# [[little]] {{gloss|a small amount}}
#: {{ux|es|Hablo un '''poco''' (de) inglés.|t=I speak a '''little''' English.}}
# a short [[time]], a little [[while]]
#: {{uxi|es|hace '''poco'''|a '''little while''' ago}}
#: {{uxi|es|dentro de '''poco'''|in a '''little bit'''}}

